      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise salon staff and individual stylists such as Javier, Esther, and Jennifer for their patience and warmth. Reviewers appreciate that the team willingly assists with lifting dogs into wash tubs and explains grooming routines clearly to first-time puppy owners and self-wash users."
